      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MR. OBERON (8) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 1.5 lengths at this track in a handy 17.37 beating Energy To Burn. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Looks the testing material. BULSARA (1) doesn't have the best strike-rate but recent form is sound. Continues to race well, filling the minors at the last three starts, the latest when third (17.77) at this track. Has a good record here at this journey. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. JAZZY BOO (6) is worth forgiving for her last effort when fourth (17.73) at this track over 305m. Solid record here winning 13 races. Cannot be taken lightly. CHEQUES TO BURN (2) must be respected at her pet track and distance. Something for the Multiples: MR. OBERON (8)",
